See ThirdParty/Omacy/Aerial-LICENSE.

The 37 upstream effects originate in TerminalTextEffects by ChrisBuilds and run through ttfx.
Aurora, Starfield and Circuit are original Macoma effects in crates/omacy-engine/src.
The upstream GIF previews in README.md are linked from the pinned ttfx source;
the original-effect GIFs are generated from Macoma native engine frames.
See vendor/ttfx/LICENSE, vendor/ttfx/NOTICE and vendor/ttfx.PIN.
The submodule at vendor/ttfx pins a native bridge commit in
https://github.com/theboringhumane/ttfx based on upstream ttfx v0.3.2.
The existing Omacy patch is committed in that fork; vendor/patches/ttfx-omacy.patch
is retained as provenance and does not need to be applied after checkout.

