under SIL Open Font License 1.1. See Resources/OFL.txt.

Upstream artwork retained in assets/ is used only for test fixtures.
The distributed Macoma name, icon and default artwork are separate from Omacy branding.

Omarchy palette definitions and adapted tmux configuration are from
https://github.com/omacom/omarchy at 77bfaca408d2993018d928e72cf84561480e5188.
Copyright and MIT terms are preserved in ThirdParty/Omarchy/LICENSE.
Source metadata and palette checksums are in ThirdParty/Omarchy/SOURCE.json.
Wallpaper image bytes are not included in this distribution; the catalog links
to upstream images on demand. Per-image redistribution rights are not asserted.
Ghostty and tmux are separately installed software, not bundled with Macoma.
